msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2960
msgid "Done once under Settings › Connectors, and every plugin on the site shares it. Until then the assistant can still answer anything that matches one of your FAQs exactly — it just cannot write anything new."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2961
msgid "Open Settings › Connectors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2965
msgid "Give it something to answer from"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2966
msgid "Publish an FAQ and every question and answer on it is read automatically — there is nothing to import. For wording no FAQ covers, write an answer by hand on AI Knowledge. Either is enough to start; most sites end up with both."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2967
msgid "Add an FAQ"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2968
msgid "Open AI Knowledge"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2972
msgid "Add the Ask AI block, then publish"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2973
msgid "Edit the page where visitors look for help — usually the FAQ page itself — insert the Ask AI block from the Awesome FAQ category, and publish. Its heading, button wording and suggested questions are all editable in the block sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2976
msgid "Check the daily budget"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2977
msgid "The defaults are already conservative, so this is a look rather than a chore: the most that can be spent in a day, and how often one visitor may ask."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2978
msgid "Open Settings"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2985
msgid "What today cost and what was asked. The split between answers served free and answers the AI wrote is the number to watch — the more of it that is free, the less the assistant costs you."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2989
msgid "Everything visitors typed, and above all the ones nothing could answer. Each of those is a gap you can close in one click, and every gap closed is answered free from then on. The lower list shows what the assistant replied and how visitors rated it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2993
msgid "Everything the assistant is allowed to answer from: your FAQs, which look after themselves, and answers you write by hand for wording no FAQ covers. This is also where you choose whether your FAQs are used at all, and set aside any single FAQ you would rather it never quoted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:2997
msgid "Spending limits, abuse protection and how the answers read. Everything here is clamped to safe values on save, so the guards cannot be switched off by accident."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3004
msgid "Setting the assistant up, what happens when somebody asks a question, and what each screen is for."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3010
msgid "Setting up"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3011
msgid "four steps, once"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3015
msgid "There is no import and no training step — the assistant reads the FAQ content you have already published."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3047
msgid "done"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3048
msgid "to do"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3059
#: build/ask-ai-promo/index.js:61
msgid "The journey of one question"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3063
msgid "Each step can end the request. Most questions never reach the last one."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3086
msgid "What each screen is for"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3090
msgid "Four screens, and only one of them needs visiting regularly — Asked Questions, where the work is."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3105
#: build/ask-ai-promo/index.js:62
msgid "It cannot make things up"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3109
msgid "The model never sees your database, your pages or the open web. It receives the question plus the FAQ snippets that matched it, and is told to answer from those and nothing else. When nothing matches closely enough the visitor is offered related questions rather than a confident guess — and the question is recorded for you on Asked Questions."
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3115
#: build/ask-ai-promo/index.js:63
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-afaq-ask-ai-admin.php:3119
msgid "Visitors are counted by a one-way hash of their address, never by the address itself, and only question text is stored — no names, no addresses, no session data. The AI provider only ever receives the question and your own FAQ snippets."
msgstr ""

